    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "This NCEI Accession includes surface underway, chemical, physical, coastal data collected from the Offshore Supply Ship Atlantic Condor in the North Atlantic Ocean, from 2019-01-14 to 2019-11-16. These data include sea surface temperature, sea surface salinity, equilibrator temperature, equilibrator pressure, mole fraction of carbon dioxide (xCO2), partial pressure (or fugacity) of carbon dioxide (pCO2) in water, conductivity and oxygen. The instruments used to collect these data include flat membrane equilibrator, conductivity sensor and oxygen optode.",
